{"id":401100162,"chapter_id":50027,"scene_id":52707,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"<i>我的父亲是位英雄。他说正义和光明永存，自己为之而战。</i>","voice":["vo_event_401101602_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"<i>可很多很多的英雄，很轻易地死在10年前的一次远行。死得毫无意义。</i>","voice":["vo_event_401101602_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"新闻","content":"入夜103年，FAC大型战役彻底失败，死亡人数拒绝公开，没有进一步解释。据消息透露，目的地是内海，生存几率为零。","voice":["vo_event_401101602_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":11,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"<i>FAC受尽唾骂，地位一落千丈，市议会甚至涅槃集团都能对它使手段。我父亲也随之变成笑柄。人们嘴上说他是英雄，心里却叫他“冤种”。</i>","voice":["vo_event_401101602_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"<i>我问，爸爸、叔叔阿姨们，都是为了正义而战，为了守护城邦而死。为什么是这个结果？大家不要正义吗？</i>","voice":["vo_event_401101602_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"<i>他们沉默，嘲笑，或是厌恶地别过脸。最后有人说，因为这些冤种自始至终看不到真相。而真相是，正义即是谎言，说……</i>","voice":["vo_event_401101602_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"<i>在这个时代，人是可以随意被剥夺的，恶是可以不受任何惩罚的。现实充斥着迷雾与阴谋，利益仇恨欲望都可以凌驾于正义之上，盲目笃信它就是愚蠢的，送死也是活该的。</i>","voice":["vo_event_401101602_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"<i>我想大声驳斥，却哑口无言。当我开始怀疑，糟糕的事就接二连三发生，我出现了不好的直觉，会把一切事情往糟糕的方向想，更可怕的是……大多数时候，它都是对的。</i>","voice":["vo_event_401101602_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"<i>如果正义存在，那这个时候，它在哪里？为什么不出来？这世界正在崩塌，溃烂出这么大的黑洞，为什么视若无睹？为什么没人填满它？</i>","voice":["vo_event_401101602_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"新闻","content":"入夜104年，涅槃集团撤离西区，W-31矿井发生大爆炸，死亡人数达万人以上。集团声称这是意外，经上庭特派员调查，接受此项解释……","voice":["vo_event_401101602_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":11,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"<i>黑洞越来越大，我走不出来，我必须做点什么。我不能眼看着我的世界跟它一起崩塌……我必须做点什么，我——</i>","voice":["vo_event_401101602_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"可可莉克","content":"花园不会听信你这些满口正义，不会听信你们任何人。一切以爱和崇高为名要人俯首的，都是肮脏的谎言。为这些外物付出的一切牺牲都是愚昧的证明。","voice":["vo_event_401101601_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"<i>W-31不是意外，是人为。我查了他们的资产转移，全是疑点，直觉告诉我，这是恶，跟爸爸他们遭遇的一样，他们都是恶。如果没人惩罚他们，那就我来，我必须去！</i>","voice":["vo_event_401101602_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"<i>有上庭人去涅槃，我就埋伏在涅槃总部附近。我被射中了，很多人来打我、抓我，说我是禁闭者。我不管，拼了命刺中一个人。</i>","voice":["vo_event_401101602_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"<i>——可却是她从枪林弹雨下保护了我。</i>","voice":["vo_event_401101602_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"？？","content":"……是吗，你是为了证明心中的正义才来……","voice":["vo_event_401101602_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"？？","content":"你快坚持不下去了吧，才会用这么激进的手段……","voice":["vo_event_401101602_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"？？","content":"不必这样……还没到时候，你还有很长的时间……听我说……","voice":["vo_event_401101602_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"？？","content":"正义当然存在，我亲眼见过。","voice":["vo_event_401101602_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"？？","content":"在另一个纯粹的、真实的世界……人心的每一面都袒露无疑……在那里，我见过正义……而它永远存在……","voice":["vo_event_401101602_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"？？","content":"现在有人为你伸张，等你长大了，就轮到你为他们努力了……","voice":["vo_event_401101602_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"speaker":"？？","content":"这样一来，你所相信的一定会……","voice":["vo_event_401101602_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":4165,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"speaker":"？？","content":"……克里斯……","voice":["vo_event_401101602_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"做噩梦了吗？","voice":["vo_event_401101602_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"speaker":"克里斯蒂娜","content":"……瑟琳……姐姐……？","voice":["vo_event_401101602_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"对，是我。对不起，我来晚了。","voice":["vo_event_401101602_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"content":"她没有再说下去，只是伸手握住了克里斯的手，两人的手都冰凉透底。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"content":"克里斯的视野逐渐清晰，再没有噩梦了，没有流血、没有杀戮。满身伤痕的小侦探怔怔地看着瑟琳，像是噩梦尚未醒来般，眼泪止不住地滚落。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"speaker":"克里斯蒂娜","content":"呜呜……对不起……对不起……","voice":["vo_event_401101602_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"speaker":"克里斯蒂娜","content":"我用刀捅了你……我把你当成坏人，还想杀你……","voice":["vo_event_401101602_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"speaker":"克里斯蒂娜","content":"我跟他们一样，是伤害别人的混蛋……对不起……","voice":["vo_event_401101602_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"content":"少女的感情倾泻而出，瑟琳就这么看着，好一会儿，她终于抬手把女孩揽进怀里。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"别这么说。你没有伤害谁，受伤的人是你。","voice":["vo_event_401101602_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":40,"content":"她的额头抵在克里斯头上，不断安抚着。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":41,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"正义永远都在，它已经在你手里了，你长大了。","voice":["vo_event_401101602_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":42,"speaker":"瑟琳","content":"你一直做得很好。","voice":["vo_event_401101602_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1},{"step":43,"speaker":"克里斯蒂娜","content":"呜呜……呜啊啊啊啊——","voice":["vo_event_401101602_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_11016","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1}]}